---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="PCLAF // Tech Lab Gamer | Servicio técnico en Floresta" description="Laboratorio técnico de PC, notebook y Gaming en Floresta. Diagnóstico, upgrades y performance con turno previo." canonical="/">
  <main class="techno-page">
    <section class="system-bar"><span>PCLAF_OS / TECH LAB</span><span class="system-live"><i></i> SYSTEM ONLINE</span><span>FLORESTA // CABA</span></section>
    <section class="command-hero">
      <div class="hero-terminal boot-panel"><div class="terminal-top"><span>PC-01 // PERFORMANCE LAB</span><span class="boot-time">00:00:00</span></div><div class="boot-kicker"><i></i> SYSTEM BOOT // READY TO PLAY</div><h1>Tu PC.<br /><span>Sin límites.</span></h1><p class="hero-description">Reparación, upgrades y performance para que tu equipo responda como tiene que responder.</p><div class="boot-stats"><div><b>99.8%</b><span>UPTIME</span></div><div><b>144</b><span>FPS READY</span></div><div><b>24°</b><span>THERMAL</span></div></div><div class="hero-buttons"><a class="btn-red" href="/turnos.html">INICIAR DIAGNÓSTICO <b>↗</b></a><a class="btn-ghost" href="/historial.html">VER MI ARREGLO</a></div><div class="boot-log"><span>[01]</span> Hardware detectado <span>[OK]</span><br /><span>[02]</span> Sistema optimizado <span>[OK]</span><br /><span>[03]</span> Esperando tu equipo<span class="cursor">_</span></div></div>
      <div class="hero-console"><div class="pc-board" aria-label="Placa madre de PC en diagnóstico"><div class="board-grid"></div><div class="board-chip"><small>CPU</small><strong>PCLAF</strong><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="board-gpu"><span>GPU // RTX READY</span><b></b><b></b><b></b></div><div class="board-ram"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>RAM 32GB</span></div><div class="board-fan"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="board-port port-one"></div><div class="board-port port-two"></div><div class="board-scan">HARDWARE SCAN <strong>98%</strong></div></div><div class="console-readout"><div><span>CPU LOAD</span><b>042%</b></div><div><span>THERMAL</span><b class="green">OPTIMAL</b></div><div><span>STATUS</span><b>READY</b></div></div><div class="console-code">HARDWARE // ONLINE<br />BOARD DIAG // RUNNING<br />NO GUESSWORK</div></div>
    </section>
    <div class="notice-line"><strong>IMPORTANTE</strong><span>Atendemos únicamente con turno previo. Somos un laboratorio cerrado, no un local a la calle.</span><a href="/turnos.html">RESERVAR TURNO ↗</a></div>
    <section class="signal-strip" aria-label="Especialidades"><span>DIAGNÓSTICO</span><b>→</b><span>REPARACIÓN</span><b>→</b><span>UPGRADE</span><b>→</b><span class="green">GAMER PERFORMANCE</span><b>→</b><span>DIAGNÓSTICO</span></section>
    <section class="modules"><div class="module-intro"><span class="module-index">MODULE_01</span><h2>¿Qué está<br /><em>fallando?</em></h2><p>Elegí el síntoma. Nosotros encontramos la causa.</p></div><div class="module-grid"><a href="/diagnostico-pc-notebook-floresta.html"><span>01 / CORE</span><strong>NO ENCIENDE</strong><p>Diagnóstico de placa, fuente y componentes.</p><i>+</i></a><a href="/optimizacion-pc-lenta-floresta.html"><span>02 / SPEED</span><strong>VA LENTA</strong><p>Optimización, limpieza y upgrades con sentido.</p><i>+</i></a><a href="/cambio-pasta-termica-notebook-caba.html"><span>03 / COOLING</span><strong>SE CALIENTA</strong><p>Temperatura, ventilación y pasta térmica.</p><i>+</i></a><a class="gamer-module" href="/limpieza-pc-gamer-floresta.html"><span>04 / GAMER</span><strong>NO RINDE</strong><p>Más FPS, menos thermal throttling.</p><i>+</i></a></div></section>
    <section class="gamer-zone"><div><span class="module-index green">GAMER_MODE // ACTIVE</span><h2>Subí el<br /><em>nivel.</em></h2><p>Limpieza profunda, airflow, pasta térmica y upgrades para que tu setup rinda cuando más lo exigís.</p><a class="btn-green" href="/limpieza-pc-gamer-floresta.html">ACTIVAR PERFORMANCE ↗</a></div><div class="fps-display"><small>FPS TARGET</small><strong class="fps-value">0</strong><span>STABLE // 1080P // READY</span><div class="fps-bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="telemetry-grid"><div><label>CPU</label><b data-metric="cpu">0%</b><i><em></em></i></div><div><label>GPU</label><b data-metric="gpu">0%</b><i><em></em></i></div><div><label>TEMP</label><b data-metric="temp">0%</b><i><em></em></i></div><div><label>RAM</label><b data-metric="ram">0%</b><i><em></em></i></div></div></div></section>
    <section class="gaming-showcase"><div class="gaming-copy"><span class="module-index green">GAMING_VISUAL // LIVE</span><h2>Jugá sin<br /><em>tirones.</em></h2><p>Una notebook gamer en modo laboratorio: estabilidad, temperatura y FPS bajo control.</p><a class="btn-green" href="/limpieza-pc-gamer-floresta.html">MEJORAR MI SETUP ↗</a></div><div class="laptop-stage"><div class="laptop-screen"><div class="cs2-video" role="img" aria-label="Animación de una partida de Counter-Strike 2 con HUD gamer"><div class="cs2-top"><span>CS2 // MATCH</span><b>ROUND 07</b><span>1:42</span></div><div class="cs2-radar"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="cs2-crosshair">+</div><div class="cs2-target">TARGET LOCKED</div><div class="cs2-bottom"><span>HP 100</span><span>ARMOR 100</span><strong>$ 2850</strong></div><div class="cs2-kill">+ KILL CONFIRMED</div></div></div><div class="laptop-base"><span></span><i></i><b>144 FPS // ULTRA STABLE</b></div></div></section><section class="how-it-works"><span class="module-index">PROTOCOL_03</span><h2>Sin humo.<br /><em>Con proceso.</em></h2><div class="protocol-list"><div><b>01</b><strong>Reservás online</strong><span>Elegís cuándo traer tu equipo.</span></div><div><b>02</b><strong>Analizamos</strong><span>Buscamos la falla, no inventamos una.</span></div><div><b>03</b><strong>Decidís</strong><span>Presupuesto claro. Vos aprobás.</span></div></div></section>
    <section class="lab-contact"><div class="contact-screen"><span>LOCATION_LOCKED</span><strong>CAMPANA 51<br /><em>FLORESTA</em></strong><small>BUENOS AIRES / CABA<br />VISITA SOLO CON TURNO</small><a href="/ubicacion.html">VER UBICACIÓN ↗</a></div><div class="map-panel"><iframe title="Ubicación de PCLAF en Campana 51, Floresta" src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=Campana+51,+Floresta,+Buenos+Aires&output=embed" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe><div class="map-overlay">MAP_LINK // ONLINE<br /><span>Campana 51 · Floresta</span></div></div><div class="contact-copy"><span class="module-index">CONNECT</span><h2>¿Listo para<br /><em>resolverlo?</em></h2><p>Contanos qué le pasa a tu equipo. Te respondemos y coordinamos el ingreso al laboratorio.</p><a class="btn-red" href="/turnos.html">RESERVAR MI TURNO <b>↗</b></a><a class="whatsapp-link" href="https://wa.me/5491135708345">O escribinos al WhatsApp</a></div></section>
    <footer class="techno-footer"><span>PCLAF // TECH LAB</span><span>PC · NOTEBOOK · GAMER</span><a href="/historial.html">HISTORIAL ↗</a></footer>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
:global(:root){--t-bg:#070809;--t-panel:#101315;--t-panel2:#171b1e;--t-white:#f4f4f1;--t-muted:#899096;--t-line:#283035;--t-red:#f0222b;--t-green:#9cff57;--t-mono:'DM Mono',monospace;--t-display:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif}.techno-page{background:var(--t-bg);color:var(--t-white);min-height:100vh;font-family:var(--t-display);overflow:hidden}.system-bar,.techno-footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:16px 4vw;border-bottom:1px solid var(--t-line);color:var(--t-muted);font:10px var(--t-mono);letter-spacing:.12em}.system-live{color:var(--t-white)}.system-live i{display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;margin-right:8px;background:var(--t-green);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--t-green);animation:pulse 1.4s infinite}.command-hero{min-height:650px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;border-bottom:1px solid var(--t-line)}.hero-terminal{padding:9vw 7vw;border-right:1px solid var(--t-line);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0a0c0d,#111518)}.micro,.module-index{color:var(--t-red);font:11px var(--t-mono);letter-spacing:.14em}.terminal-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:80px;color:var(--t-muted);font:10px var(--t-mono)}h1,h2{font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.08em;line-height:.84;margin:22px 0}h1{font-size:clamp(64px,9vw,138px)}h1 span,h2 em{color:var(--t-red);font-style:normal}.hero-description{max-width:440px;color:var(--t-muted);font-size:16px;line-height:1.55}.boot-panel{position:relative;isolation:isolate}.boot-panel:before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,transparent 0 5px,#fff006 6px),linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0 92%,#f0222b 92% 92.3%,transparent 92.3%);opacity:.18;pointer-events:none;animation:bootScan 5s linear infinite}.boot-kicker{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:var(--t-green);font:11px var(--t-mono);letter-spacing:.12em;margin:0 0 30px}.boot-kicker i{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--t-green);box-shadow:0 0 14px var(--t-green);animation:pulse 1s infinite}.boot-stats{display:flex;gap:25px;margin-top:30px;padding:15px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--t-line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--t-line)}.boot-stats div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}.boot-stats b{color:var(--t-white);font:700 20px var(--t-mono)}.boot-stats span{color:var(--t-muted);font:9px var(--t-mono);letter-spacing:.08em}.boot-log{margin-top:28px;color:var(--t-muted);font:10px/1.8 var(--t-mono)}.boot-log span{color:var(--t-green)}.boot-log span:first-child{color:var(--t-red)}.cursor{animation:cursorBlink .8s infinite}.hero-buttons{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:32px}.btn-red,.btn-green,.btn-ghost{display:inline-flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;padding:16px 18px;text-decoration:none;font:700 11px var(--t-mono);transition:.25s}.btn-red{background:var(--t-red);color:#fff}.btn-red:hover{background:#fff;color:#070809;transform:translateY(-4px)}.btn-green{background:var(--t-green);color:#071006}.btn-green:hover{box-shadow:0 0 28px #9cff5744;transform:translateY(-4px)}.btn-ghost{border:1px solid var(--t-line);color:var(--t-white)}.btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--t-red);transform:translateY(-4px)}.hero-console{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;position:relative;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%,#262d30 0,#111416 22%,#070809 65%)}.console-ring{width:min(35vw,390px);aspect-ratio:1;border:1px solid #475057;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;position:relative;animation:rotate 24s linear infinite}.console-ring:before,.console-ring:after{content:'';position:absolute;border:1px dashed #4b565c;border-radius:50%}.console-ring:before{inset:12%;animation:rotate 13s linear infinite reverse}.console-ring:after{inset:25%;border-color:var(--t-red)}.ring-core{width:98px;height:98px;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;border:1px solid var(--t-red);border-radius:50%;color:var(--t-red);font:700 17px var(--t-mono);